  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Based on the Testing Considerations:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Assessment+Plan+-+Performance#AssessmentPlan-Performance-TestingConsiderations"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Assessment+Plan+-+Performance#AssessmentPlan-Performance-TestingConsiderations",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "...please modify (or simply run) existing test (ingest.py) to achieve the following three states:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "a steady state is achieved",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "a declining state is achieved",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Fedora 4 exhibits high error rates or stops responding",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Please collect and document the results in a way that:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "someone else can run the same tests",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "it is clear where the failure points are, i.e. how many objects before failure, or what rate of ingest before failure, etc",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once we have demonstrated that the grinder framework is actually useful in assessing F4 performance, then we can move on to the access tests.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here are some results from last sprint: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Grinder+Results"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Grinder+Results",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
